      "id": "claim_7b59192f4bf64945b75e603ed4b9a968",
      "statement": "apps/server/src/index.ts is the single composition root: it loads and validates the environment, constructs a Drizzle Db over a pg Pool and a service-role Supabase client, and injects both plus Env into buildApp as AppDeps — the seam tests use to build app instances; the process listens on 0.0.0.0 at env.PORT (default 3000).",
