      "id": "claim_9d8c980ac9ae49449ff94e22cf15bd96",
      "statement": "The repository contains no routing or navigation runtime: apps/server has no transit graph builder, Dijkstra implementation, navigation endpoint or request-time virtual nodes, and it exposes no /api/graph/status route even though ADR-0005 and docs/DEVIATIONS.md D2 name that route as the retained debug surface; there is also no commuter-facing route/stop/navigate API, no GPS-trace or trust-scoring ingestion, no Redis or job infrastructure, and no deployment artifacts such as a Dockerfile, compose file or platform manifest.",
